"Code cache" = "代码缓存";
"A bigger code cache empties less often and takes more memory (about 1.75 times its size); Henge picks one by its memory limit: 1.5 GB where there is plenty, 512 MB where there is little. Applies the next time Henge opens. If JIT stops turning on, or a Mac closes Henge during setup, choose a smaller one." = "代码缓存越大，清空得越少，占用的内存也越多（约为其大小的 1.75 倍）；Henge 会按内存上限自动选：充裕时 1.5 GB，紧张时 512 MB。下次打开 Henge 时生效。如果 JIT 开不起来，或 Mac 在设置过程中让 Henge 闪退，请选小一点的。";
"macOS draws a frame for every refresh: 30 Hz leaves the most of the emulated CPU to apps, at the cost of choppier animation; 60 Hz is smoother. Faster disk writes order them without waiting for a full sync; a sudden power loss could lose the last ones. Quicker wake keeps an idle CPU watching for work for 50 µs, at some battery cost. Superblocks let translated code run past conditional branches. Changes apply the next time a Mac starts." = "macOS 每次刷新都要画一帧：30 Hz 把最多的模拟 CPU 留给应用，但动画不够流畅；60 Hz 更顺滑。“更快的磁盘写入”下达写入时不等完整同步，突然断电可能丢失最后几次写入。“更快唤醒”让空闲的 CPU 多等 50 微秒看有没有任务，会多耗一点电。“超级块”让翻译后的代码可以越过条件分支继续执行。更改在下次启动 Mac 时生效。";
"Instant Resume" = "即时恢复";
"Resume where you left off" = "从上次离开的地方继续";
"When you leave Henge, the running Mac is saved to storage, and opening it again picks up where it was in a few seconds, even after iOS closes Henge. The save is about the size of the Mac's memory in use, compressed. The Mac pauses while Henge is in the background, so its sound stops. Experimental." = "离开 Henge 时，正在运行的 Mac 会保存到存储空间；再次打开时几秒内就能回到原来的状态，即使 iOS 已经关闭了 Henge。保存的大小约等于 Mac 已用内存压缩后的大小。Henge 在后台时 Mac 会暂停，声音也会停。实验性功能。";
"Mac Apps" = "Mac 应用";
"Mac apps without macOS" = "不启动 macOS 运行 Mac 应用";
"Bring in a .dmg or an .app (the + button on Home) and run it inside Henge through its own translation layer, without starting a Mac. Programs without windows run today; apps with windows don't yet. Experimental." = "导入 .dmg 或 .app（首页的 + 按钮），通过 Henge 自己的转译层直接在 Henge 里运行，不用启动 Mac。目前没有窗口的程序可以运行，有窗口的应用还不行。实验性功能。";
