"LocalDevVPN can show Connected while iOS still sends Henge's connection over cellular. Turn Cellular Data off in Control Center, wait 2 seconds, then turn it back on. Or join any Wi-Fi once; a hotspot works. Keep LocalDevVPN connected, turn off other VPNs such as Tailscale, then try again." = "LocalDevVPN 可能显示“已连接”，但 iOS 仍把 Henge 的连接走了蜂窝网络。请在控制中心关闭蜂窝数据，等 2 秒再打开。或者连一次任意 Wi-Fi，热点也行。保持 LocalDevVPN 连接，关掉 Tailscale 等其他 VPN，然后重试。";
