"The debugger is attached but is not answering trap requests, and this device will not execute a MAP_JIT mapping either, so no executable memory could be claimed. This happens when Henge was opened from StikDebug's app list, which attaches without Henge's script: open Henge from the Home Screen and tap Turn On JIT. It also happens inside another container app." = "调试器已附加，但不响应陷阱请求，这台设备也不执行 MAP_JIT 映射，所以申请不到可执行内存。从 StikDebug 的应用列表里打开 Henge 时会这样（它附加时没带 Henge 的脚本）：请从主屏幕打开 Henge，再点“开启 JIT”。在其他容器 App 里运行时也会这样。";
