"Enable JIT" = "启用 JIT";
"Check setup" = "检查设置";
"StikDebug is a separate app that attaches to Henge. Henge sends it the JIT script itself, so nothing needs configuring for Henge inside StikDebug." = "StikDebug 是一个独立的 App，它会附加到 Henge。JIT 脚本由 Henge 自己发给它，所以不用在 StikDebug 里为 Henge 做任何配置。";
