"Whenever you start a Mac, Henge opens StikDebug, which attaches and comes back." = "每次启动 Mac 时，Henge 会打开 StikDebug，它附加后再跳回来。";
"TrollStore can enable JIT for apps it installed, with no pairing file, VPN or computer." = "TrollStore 可以为它安装的 App 开启 JIT，不需要配对文件、VPN 或电脑。";
"Install Henge.ipa through TrollStore, on an iOS version TrollStore supports. It carries the entitlements TrollStore keeps, so the same file works there and in a sideloader." = "在 TrollStore 支持的 iOS 版本上，通过 TrollStore 安装 Henge.ipa。它带有 TrollStore 会保留的权限，所以同一个文件在 TrollStore 和侧载工具里都能用。";
"In TrollStore's Settings, turn on URL Scheme. TrollStore ignores enable-jit requests without it." = "在 TrollStore 的设置里打开 URL Scheme。不打开的话，TrollStore 会忽略开启 JIT 的请求。";
"Whenever a Mac starts, Henge asks TrollStore to enable JIT. TrollStore opens Henge, attaches to it for a moment and lets go, which leaves it allowed to run code it wrote." = "每次启动 Mac 时，Henge 会请 TrollStore 开启 JIT。TrollStore 打开 Henge，短暂附加后松开，Henge 就被允许运行自己写入的代码了。";
"TrollStore was not found on this %@. It installs on iOS 14.0 to 17.0." = "这台 %@ 上没有找到 TrollStore。它只能装在 iOS 14.0 到 17.0 上。";
"On a device jailbroken with Dopamine, JIT is a setting: the jailbreak marks every app as debugged when it opens, and a debugged app may run code it wrote. Henge needs nothing else." = "在用 Dopamine 越狱的设备上，JIT 只是一个开关：越狱会在每个 App 打开时把它标记为“被调试”，而被调试的 App 可以运行自己写入的代码。Henge 不需要别的了。";
