"Running…" = "正在运行…";
"Run" = "运行";
"Programs run inside Henge, one per launch. After one has run, quit Henge and open it again to run another or to start a Mac." = "程序在 Henge 内运行，每次打开只能运行一个。运行过一个之后，要退出 Henge 再重新打开，才能运行另一个或启动 Mac。";
"Output" = "输出";
"(nothing printed)" = "（没有输出）";
"Open (experimental)" = "打开（实验性）";
"It runs inside Henge, one app per launch, without a Mac. Tap to click, scroll with one finger, drag with two, hold for a right click; the keyboard button brings up the keyboard. Quit Henge (swipe it away) to stop it." = "它在 Henge 内运行，每次打开只能运行一个应用，不需要 Mac。轻点是点按，单指滚动，双指拖移，按住是右键点按；键盘按钮可以调出键盘。退出 Henge（在后台把它划掉）即可停止它。";
"Could not run it: %@" = "无法运行：%@";
"Finished with code %@." = "已结束，退出码 %@。";
"This app has no menus" = "这个应用没有菜单";
"The previous machine has not been released." = "上一台机器还没有释放。请彻底退出 Henge 再重新打开。";
"The ROM, disk and auxiliary storage are all needed." = "缺少 ROM、磁盘或辅助存储，三者都需要。";
"Cannot open the disk image." = "无法打开磁盘映像。";
"Cannot open the auxiliary storage." = "无法打开辅助存储。";
"Cannot set up the JIT region." = "无法设置 JIT 代码区。请确认 JIT 已开启。";
"Cannot build the machine (not enough memory for the guest's RAM?)." = "无法建立机器：放不下这台 Mac 的内存。请把这台 Mac 的内存调小，或在“设置 › 性能”里把代码缓存改成 512 MB，然后彻底退出 Henge 再重新打开。";
"Cannot read the ROM (AVPBooter.vmapple2.bin)." = "无法读取 ROM（AVPBooter.vmapple2.bin）。";
"Henge can only give this Mac %@ MB of memory right now. Quit Henge (swipe it away) and open it again; if that doesn't help, choose a smaller code cache in Settings." = "Henge 现在只能给这台 Mac %@ MB 内存，太少了。请彻底退出 Henge（在后台把它划掉）再重新打开；还不行的话，在“设置 › 性能”里把代码缓存改小。";
